msgstr "自动（盲插）"

msgid "Fixed port"
msgstr "固定端口"

msgid "Fixed WAN port"
msgstr "固定 WAN 口"

msgid "Only used in fixed mode."
msgstr "仅在固定模式下有效。"

msgid "Probe timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "探测超时（秒）"

msgid "Detect now"
msgstr "立即探测"

msgid "Use as WAN"
msgstr "设为 WAN 口"

msgid "Off: the WAN stays where it is, however the cables are plugged."
msgstr "关闭后无论怎么插线，WAN 都停在原来的口上。"

msgid "Automatic: whichever port has the uplink cable takes the WAN role. Fixed: always the port below (use this for PPPoE or a static address upstream, which cannot be detected)."
msgstr "自动：上行线插在哪个口，哪个口就当 WAN。固定：始终使用下面选定的端口（上行为 PPPoE 或静态地址时用这个，那种情况探测不到）。"

msgid "How long each port is given to answer the probe. The worst case of a full scan is this times four."
msgstr "每个端口等待应答的时间。全部扫一遍的最坏耗时是这个值的四倍。"

msgid "Guess when only one cable is plugged in"
msgstr "只有一根网线时按它猜"

msgid "Automatic mode only finds an uplink that answers DHCP; PPPoE and static uplinks do not. With this on, a single cable that is not in the current WAN port is taken as the uplink. It also fires when a lone computer is the only thing plugged in, which would then lose its LAN connection — that is why it is off by default."
msgstr "自动模式只能发现应答 DHCP 的上行；PPPoE 和静态上行不会应答。打开这一项后，如果只插了一根网线、且不在当前 WAN 口，就把它当上行口。但如果只接了一台电脑，也会命中，那台电脑就会失去 LAN 连接——所以默认关闭。"

msgid "No candidate ports found: /sbin/e2631-wanport is not installed on this router."
msgstr "没有找到候选端口：本路由器未安装 /sbin/e2631-wanport。"

msgid "The switch could not be started: %s"
msgstr "无法启动切换：%s"

msgid "Detection could not be started: %s"
msgstr "无法启动探测：%s"

msgid "Switching the WAN to %s. The uplink drops for a few seconds while the bridge and the WAN interface are moved."
msgstr "正在把 WAN 切到 %s。移动网桥和 WAN 接口期间上行会中断几秒。"

msgid "Detection started: the ports with a cable are probed one by one. The result appears in the table above within a few seconds."
msgstr "已开始探测：逐个测试插了网线的端口，几秒内结果会出现在上表。"

msgid "The service is switched off: nothing happens automatically until it is enabled below."
msgstr "服务已关闭：在下面启用之前不会有任何自动动作。"

msgid "LAN and WAN are roles here, not hardware. In automatic mode the router DHCP-probes the ports that have a cable and gives the WAN role to the one that is answered; in fixed mode it always uses the chosen port. The WAN MAC stays the same either way, so the lease and the IPv6 identity of this router survive a port change."
msgstr "这里的 LAN 和 WAN 是角色而不是硬件。自动模式下，路由器对插了网线的端口做一次 DHCP 探测，把 WAN 角色给有应答的那个；固定模式下始终使用选定的端口。两种模式的 WAN MAC 都不变，所以换口之后上游租约和本机的 IPv6 身份都能延续。"

msgid "Any of the four wired ports can carry the uplink. This is the same feature the factory calls \"WAN/LAN adaptive\", implemented without touching the switch: a port is a WAN port when the WAN interface is bound to it and it is out of the LAN bridge."
msgstr "四个有线口都可以当上行口。这就是原厂说的「WAN/LAN 自适应」，只是不碰交换芯片：WAN 接口绑在哪个口上、且该口不在 LAN 网桥里，哪个口就是 WAN 口。"
